 "final_prompt": "Help me shop for tonight. Recipe: lemon garlic chicken with potatoes. Pantry staples I own are salt, olive oil, and oregano, so exclude those. Format it as a shopping list, one item per line, four lines in total, covering chicken, lemons, garlic, and potatoes.\n\n<document>\nWeeknight lemon chicken (serves 4)\n\nIngredients\n4 chicken thighs\n2 lemons\n3 cloves garlic\n1 tbsp olive oil\n1 tsp dried oregano\n1 lb baby potatoes\nsalt\n\nSteps\n1. Preheat the oven to 425°F.\n2. Toss the potatoes with the olive oil and salt.\n3. Rub the chicken with garlic, oregano and lemon zest.\n4. Roast everything for 35 minutes, squeeze the lemons over the top, and serve.\n</document>",
